  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>\"Blaster Pistol\" is a blanket term for literally thousands of different designs from hundreds of manufacturers, such as the popular BlasTech DL-18. Blaster Pistols are popular with urban police forces, traders, and anyone who needs to pack respectable firepower in an easily carried package. </p><p>A Blaster Pistol requires a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> to operate. After 100 shots, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> must be replaced. </p>",
